abstract: >-
  Reference implementations, AVX-512 kernels, benchmark drivers and result files for the
  technical report on microarchitecture-aware spatial and temporal computation skipping for
  CNN inference. The report identifies three coupled constraints that decide whether MAC
  reductions become wall-clock time: SIMD execution granularity, load-port throughput per FMA,
  and the convolution topology that fixes how much arithmetic one skipping decision controls.
keywords:
  - CNN inference acceleration
  - AVX-512
  - structured sparsity
  - channel permutation
  - temporal reuse
